1
00:04:50,526 --> 00:04:56,526
Astonishing. Intimate. Definitive.

2
00:09:41,052 --> 00:09:47,052
Ronaldo is a documentary, history film directed by Anthony Wonke.

3
00:14:31,578 --> 00:14:37,578
Filmed over 14 months with unprecedented access into the inner circle of the man and the sport, this is the
first official and fully authorised film of one of the most celebrated figures in football.

4
00:19:22,105 --> 00:19:28,105
For the first time ever, the world gets vividly candid and un-paralleled, behind-closed-doors access to
the footballer, father, family-man and friend in this moving & fascinating documentary.

5
00:24:12,631 --> 00:24:18,631
Through in-depth conversations, state of the art football footage and never before seen archival footage, the film gives an astonishing
insight into the sporting and personal life of triple Ballon D'Or winner Cristiano Ronaldo at the peak of his career.

6
00:29:03,157 --> 00:29:09,157
From the makers of ‘Senna’ and ‘Amy’, Ronaldo takes audiences on an intimate and revealing
journey of what it’s like to live as an iconic athlete in the eye of the storm.

